    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">** 10 Chemistry and 1 Physics VR Modules \u2013 Available for $7.99 Each! **</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the most engaging way to learn Chemistry and Physics with immersive, gamified Virtual Reality experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 Hold molecules in your hand in Reaction Balancing </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 Shoot particles to create atoms in Atom Structure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 Work the salts assembly line to learn the nomenclature of Salts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 Solve the Chemistry puzzle in Oxygen Escape Room </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 Experiment with the properties of gases and metals to learn about Hydrogen and Oxygen </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And so much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Proven Learning Value</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-created with award-winning science teachers, Futuclass VR modules have been tested in real classrooms and at home. Students explore, make mistakes, receive instant feedback, and progress at their own pace\u2014keeping even the most restless learners engaged.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What\u2019s Included?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 10 Chemistry modules \u2013 Atomic Structure, Chemical Bonds, Reaction Balancing, Hydrogen &amp; Oxygen, Oxygen Escape Room, Acids, Bases &amp; Salts, Salts, Moles &amp; Molarity 1-2, Redox Reactions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 1 Physics modules \u2013 Nuclear Reactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Lesson Plans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Futuclass Teacher Portal \u2013 Access best practices and monitor student progress in real time via web browser </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*</strong>\u00a0For ages 13 and up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>**\u00a0</strong>Also available via Steam PC Caf\u00e9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><br></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">** 10 Chemistry and 1 Physics VR Modules \u2013 Available for $7.99 Each! **</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the most engaging way to learn Chemistry and Physics with immersive, gamified Virtual Reality experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 Hold molecules in your hand in Reaction Balancing </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 Shoot particles to create atoms in Atom Structure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 Work the salts assembly line to learn the nomenclature of Salts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 Solve the Chemistry puzzle in Oxygen Escape Room </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 Experiment with the properties of gases and metals to learn about Hydrogen and Oxygen </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And so much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Proven Learning Value</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-created with award-winning science teachers, Futuclass VR modules have been tested in real classrooms and at home. Students explore, make mistakes, receive instant feedback, and progress at their own pace\u2014keeping even the most restless learners engaged.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What\u2019s Included?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 10 Chemistry modules \u2013 Atomic Structure, Chemical Bonds, Reaction Balancing, Hydrogen &amp; Oxygen, Oxygen Escape Room, Acids, Bases &amp; Salts, Salts, Moles &amp; Molarity 1-2, Redox Reactions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 1 Physics modules \u2013 Nuclear Reactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Lesson Plans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Futuclass Teacher Portal \u2013 Access best practices and monitor student progress in real time via web browser </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*</strong>\u00a0For ages 13 and up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>**\u00a0</strong>Also available via Steam PC Caf\u00e9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><br></p>",
